# Repository map (MX Fantasy League)

Use this index before broad searches. Full conventions: `AGENTS.md`.

## Entry points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.py` | **Production** WSGI app (`gunicorn main:app`). Registers all blueprints. |
| `app/__init__.py` | `create_app()` factory; subset of blueprints for gradual migration. |
| `app.py` | Legacy monolith (large); prefer `app/routes/` + `main.py` for new work. |
| `models.py` | All SQLAlchemy models (single file). |
| `wsgi.py` | Deployment hook if used by host. |

## HTTP layer — `app/routes/`

| Module | Blueprint | Notes |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| `public.py` | `public` | Pages, SEO landings, core UI |
| `api.py` | `/api` | JSON API |
| `admin.py` | `admin` | Admin UI |
| `auth.py` | `auth` | Login, register, Google OAuth |
| `race_picks.py` | `race_picks` | Race tipping flows |
| `mxon_picks.py` | `mxon_picks` | MXoN nation/class picks |
| `leagues.py` | `leagues` | Leagues, membership |
| `league_challenges.py` | `league_challenges` | Challenge badges |
| `pit_lane.py` | `pit_lane` | Pit lane / social feed |
| `invite.py` | `invite` | Invites and share cards |
| `series_status.py` | `series_status` | Series open/closed status |
| `results_admin.py` | `results_admin` | Import/admin for results |
| `kundmail.py` | `kundmail` | Customer email tooling |
| `push_api.py` | `push_api` | Web push |
| `debug_tools.py` | `debug_tools` | Dev-only helpers |

Blueprint registration list in code: search `register_blueprint` in `main.py`.

## Domain logic — `services/`

Business rules live here when extracted from routes: `scoring.py`, `race_picks.py`, `picks_lock.py`, `results_import.py`, `official_leagues.py`, `league_challenges.py`, `invite_share.py`, `series_status.py`, `schema_patches.py`, etc.

## Root-level modules (grep by feature name)

Poster/social/ops scripts often sit at repo root: `*_poster_service.py`, `pit_lane_service.py`, `reminder_service.py`, `push_service.py`, `trojtryck_service.py`, plus fetch/import `*_fetch.py`, `seed_*.py`, `scoring.py`.

## Front-end

- Templates: `templates/` (Jinja2; Swedish UI copy).
- Client JS/CSS: `static/*.js`, `static/*.css` (not under ignored image dirs).
- PWA: `static/sw.js`; registered from `app/__init__.py`.

## Data and schema

- Migrations: `migrations/versions/`
- Seed/paste data: `data/`
- Env template: `env.example` (never commit `.env`)

## What is intentionally not indexed

See `.cursorignore` (bulk images, `tools/gs`, caches). If you need an asset path, search string literals in `.py` / `templates/`.
